  "title": "Jagged Dense Korean Lettuce Stew",
  "description": "A fermented, dense, and plant-based friendly stew featuring iceberg lettuce, cooked in a ttukbaegi earthenware pot, inspired by monsoon season Polish and Korean flavors.",
  "cuisine": "Korean",
